---
Checks an origin's signed deployment policy against a key you trust. Does not show what its server runs

Usage: leptoskit verify deployment [OPTIONS] --origin <ORIGIN> --key <HEX>

Options:
      --origin <ORIGIN>          The website or API origin to check, such as `https://example.com`
      --key <HEX>                A deployment public key you trust, in hex; repeat for each. Get it from the project, never from the website being checked
      --repository <REPOSITORY>  The repository the policy must name
      --policy <POLICY>          Read the signed policy from this file instead of the origin
      --state <STATE>            A file remembering the newest policy seen, so an older one is refused
  -h, --help                     Print help
  -V, --version                  Print version
